Observation-only EHCI isochronous OUT accounting: count the OUT iTD
transactions EHCI executes, by device result. A failing OUT transaction is
reported to the guest as success (EHCI 3.3.2 allows XACTERR only on IN), so
its loss is otherwise silent. Traces: usb_ehci_iso_out_fail per failure and
usb_ehci_iso_out_summary every 8000 transactions and at port detach.
Apply AFTER qemu-iso, qemu-poll, qemu-wait, qemu-orphan and qemu-acct
patches to QEMU v11.1.0 commit 84f07211cc5b4fc6a371559bf8a5de4fb068e648.
The emulator as a whole remains GPL-2.0-or-later. hcd-ehci.c keeps its
original upstream notice:
